          "additionalInformation": {
            "de": [
              "Außerhalb der Schulferien :\r\nMontag: 7h-8h40 / 11h30-13h40 / 16h-19h40\r\nDienstag: 11.30-13.40 Uhr / 16.00-19.40 Uhr\r\nMittwoch: 9h-19h40\r\nDonnerstag: 7h-8h40 / 11H-13h40 / 16h-19h40\r\nFreitag: 7h-8h40 / 11H-13h40 / 16h-21h40\r\nSamstag: 9h-19h40\r\nSonntag: 10h-17h40\r\n\r\n- Öffnungszeiten während der Schulferien:\r\n> Weihnachtsferien\r\nMontag, Freitag: 12.00 - 19.40 Uhr\r\nDienstag, Mittwoch, Donnerstag: 10:00 - 17:40 Uhr\r\nSamstag: 10.40 - 16.40 Uhr\r\n\r\n> Frühlingsferien\r\nMontag,Dienstag, Mittwoch und Freitag: 9.00 - 19.40 Uhr, Donnerstag 7.00 - 19.40 Uhr\r\nsamstag, Sonntag: 10h - 17h40"
            ],
            "en": [
              "Outside school vacations:\r\nMonday: 7am-8.40am / 11.30am-1.40pm / 4pm-7.40pm\r\nTuesday: 11:30am-1:40pm / 4pm-7:40pm\r\nWednesday: 9am-7.40pm\r\nThursday: 7am-8.40am / 11am-13.40pm / 4pm-19.40pm\r\nFriday: 7am-8.40am / 11am-1.40pm / 4pm-9.40pm\r\nSaturday: 9am-7.40pm\r\nSunday: 10am-5.40pm\r\n\r\n- Opening times during school vacations:\r\n> Christmas vacations\r\nMonday, Friday: 12h - 19h40\r\nTuesday, Wednesday, Thursday: 10am - 5.40pm\r\nSaturday: 10.40am - 4.40pm\r\n\r\n> Spring vacations\r\nMonday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Friday: 9am - 7.40pm, Thursday 7am - 7.40pm\r\nsaturday, Sunday: 10am - 5.40pm"
            ],
            "it": [
              "Al di fuori delle vacanze scolastiche:\r\nLunedì: 7.00-8.40 / 11.30-13.40 / 16.00-19.40\r\nMartedì: 11.30-13.40 / 16.00-19.40\r\nMercoledì: 9.00-19.40\r\nGiovedì: 7.00-8.40 / 11.00-13.40 / 16.00-19.40\r\nVenerdì: 7.00-8.40 / 11.00-13.40 / 16.00-21.40\r\nSabato: 9.00-19.40\r\nDomenica: 10.00-17.40\r\n\r\n- Orari di apertura durante le vacanze scolastiche:\r\n> vacanze di Natale\r\nLunedì, venerdì: dalle 12.00 alle 19.40\r\nMartedì, mercoledì, giovedì: dalle 10.00 alle 17.40\r\nSabato: 10.40-16.40\r\n\r\n> Vacanze di primavera\r\nLunedì, martedì, mercoledì e venerdì: 9.00 - 19.40, giovedì 7.00 - 19.40\r\nsabato e domenica: dalle 10.00 alle 17.40"
            ],
            "fr": [
              "Hors vacances scolaires :\r\nLundi : 7h-8h40 / 11h30-13h40 / 16h-19h40\r\nMardi : 11h30-13h40 / 16h-19h40\r\nMercredi : 9h-19h40\r\nJeudi : 7h-8h40 / 11H-13h40 / 16h-19h40\r\nVendredi : 7h-8h40 / 11H-13h40 / 16h-21h40\r\nSamedi : 9h-19h40\r\nDimanche : 10h-17h40\r\n\r\n- Horaires d'ouverture pendant les vacances scolaires :\r\n> Vacances de Noël \r\nLundi, vendredi : 12h - 19h40\r\nMardi, mercredi, jeudi : 10h - 17h40\r\nSamedi : 10h40 - 16h40\r\n\r\n> Vacances de printemps \r\nLundi,mardi, mercredi et vendredi : 9h - 19h40, jeudi 7h - 19h40\r\nsamedi, dimanche : 10h - 17h40"
            ],
            "es": [
              "Fuera de las vacaciones escolares :\r\nLunes: de 7.00 a 8.40 / de 11.30 a 13.40 / de 16.00 a 19.40\r\nMartes: 11.30-13.40 / 16.00-19.40\r\nMiércoles: de 9.00 a 19.40\r\nJueves: 7.00 a 8.40 h / 11.00 a 13.40 h / 16.00 a 19.40 h\r\nViernes: 7.00 a 8.40 h / 11.00 a 13.40 h / 16.00 a 21.40 h\r\nSábado: de 9.00 a 19.40\r\nDomingo: de 10.00 a 17.40\r\n\r\n- Horario durante las vacaciones escolares:\r\n> Vacaciones de Navidad\r\nLunes, viernes: de 12.00 h. a 19.40 h\r\nMartes, miércoles y jueves: de 10.00 h. a 17.40 h\r\nSábado: de 10.40 h. a 16.40 h\r\n\r\n> Vacaciones de primavera\r\nLunes, martes, miércoles y viernes: de 9.00 h. a 19.40 h., jueves de 7.00 h. a 19.40 h\r\nsábados y domingos: de 10.00 h. a 17.40 h"
